  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, the bravo chooses a whim from the list at the end of the class description, representing his own unique combat style and blend of martial prowess and skill. The bravo gains the spheres associated with his whim as bonus spheres, in addition to an additional ability from his chosen whim at 2nd level, 5th level, and every 5 levels thereafter.</p>\n<p>If a whim ability would call for a saving throw, it is equal to the highest saving throw DC of the spheres associated with his whim.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
